    "$t": "山陀兒"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>廖啟助</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「山陀兒」（San-tô-jî）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是性地真bái ê tshit-thô囡仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā樹仔sak-sak--倒</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā厝頂掀掀--去</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā kha̋ng-páng拆拆--落</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā玻璃摃摃--破</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā路仔tshiâng-tshiâng--歹</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā石壁ián-ián--倒</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā橋跤沖沖--斷</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā轎車淹淹--去</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下仔kā水果菜蔬sńg-tn̄g了了</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē輸看任何代誌lóng bē順眼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">到底阮是佗位去得失--你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iah是</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你是天公伯--à</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">派來beh警告--阮--ê！</span></p><div><br /></div><p>&nbsp;</p><a name='more'></a><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiLp40150SZAYMvdx5K-PC7knCFaW81Hx0ZA4AgYjnN7F4hsP_BB4jV1PG40vUXqHYQ1REFYNb4Q6He69wyjNVlM9j4DzRBZrxMIAVwJfTiSFpnPVbMDAgNh5jvywuski4-YdNYlJ0dn1bnK7B1eevpWwUlqTZf-P3sP-IiZVPv0LMprw8-BT-oEeZnyM00/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1368%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiLp40150SZAYMvdx5K-PC7knCFaW81Hx0ZA4AgYjnN7F4hsP_BB4jV1PG40vUXqHYQ1REFYNb4Q6He69wyjNVlM9j4DzRBZrxMIAVwJfTiSFpnPVbMDAgNh5jvywuski4-YdNYlJ0dn1bnK7B1eevpWwUlqTZf-P3sP-IiZVPv0LMprw8-BT-oEeZnyM00/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1368%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: x-large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhWMDRUHb-HjjX8YGQJYyZBcTItyAEDsjDxzCAG47Sx1a_CMB0t5Ca4qsC_bgioyzxdqICglyzteQHDGvwe2yD8M6Gnk7aSAOBzgOWfy5UyE3jVjvga1a8DuJ8QmXK-rZarCeJ7eHtpOA_QN7Ch-bpXEJ9gXtjTWcYe3b0ZAMfr8EGDrqMU-hK7hbZ069Uf/s1424/368%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhWMDRUHb-HjjX8YGQJYyZBcTItyAEDsjDxzCAG47Sx1a_CMB0t5Ca4qsC_bgioyzxdqICglyzteQHDGvwe2yD8M6Gnk7aSAOBzgOWfy5UyE3jVjvga1a8DuJ8QmXK-rZarCeJ7eHtpOA_QN7Ch-bpXEJ9gXtjTWcYe3b0ZAMfr8EGDrqMU-hK7hbZ069Uf/w450-h640/368%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">#做伙來唸詩 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-siz